            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka waco ni, “Ka winowinjan kicutho gi timo gim'atero ni otire kodi luwo or paran, akibino miyo win gir'acula ma two m'akelo kwoŋ Jomisir. An abedo Rwoth ma botho two mewin.”",
